{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:09.88](Play it one more time)\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.34]I been living fast, fast, fast, fast\n[00:14.84]Feeling really bad, bad, bad, bad\n[00:17.32]Time really moves fast, fast, fast, fast\n[00:19.94]Better hurry up and get in your bag, bag, bag, bag\n[00:22.86]I wear Dior, not a fad, fad, fad, fad\n[00:25.46]I know all these niggas gettin' mad, mad, mad, mad\n[00:28.32]My hand on my trigger, I’ma die for respect, yeah\n[00:31.26]Fucking with my money, you get dealt like that, yeah\n[Verse 1]\n[00:34.50]I took too many pills, countin' up the bills, uh\n[00:37.44]Molly in my cup, I can't tell you how I feel, uh\n[00:40.36]Oh, last call\n[00:42.80]Oh-oh, it’s gnarly\n[00:45.64]Every day I be counting up, counting up the blues\n[00:48.56]Gotta win sometimes when you always lose\n[00:51.32]I get high as a bitch, still the same dude\n[00:54.28]I was back then, but now I'm lost and confused\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[00:57.30]I ain't see it comin'\n[01:00.14]I ain't see it comin'\n[01:02.86]But it still came\n[01:04.84]I'm talkin' ’bout life, ayy (Talkin’ 'bout life, ayy)\n[Chorus]\n[01:08.62]I been living fast, fast, fast, fast\n[01:11.32]Feeling really bad, bad, bad, bad\n[01:13.78]Time really moves fast, fast, fast, fast\n[01:16.42]Better hurry up and get in your bag, bag, bag, bag\n[01:19.34]I wear Dior, not a fad, fad, fad, fad\n[01:21.60]I know all these niggas gettin’ mad, mad, mad, mad\n[01:24.88]My hand on my trigger, I'ma die for respect, yeah\n[01:27.72]Fucking with my money, you get dealt like that, yeah\n[Verse 2]\n[01:30.62]I go through so much, I'm 19 years old\n[01:34.00]It's been months since I felt at home\n[01:36.74]But it’s okay 'cause I'm rich, sike\n[01:39.62]I'm still sad as a bitch, right\n[01:42.22]I don't want nobody to think that I'm a asshole\n[01:45.34]I don't try to be mean on purpose, I promise\n[01:47.84]My mama taught me better than that, I'll be honest\n[01:50.74]I'll blame it on the drugs and this life I'm involved in\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[01:53.66]I ain't see it comin' (I ain't see it)\n[01:56.38]I ain't see it comin' (I ain't see it)\n[01:59.36]But it still came (Yeah, yeah, it still came)\n[02:01.42]I'm talkin' 'bout life, ayy (Talkin' 'bout life, ayy)\n[Chorus]\n[02:05.04]I been living fast, fast, fast, fast\n[02:07.78]Feeling really bad, bad, bad, bad\n[02:10.26]Time really moves fast, fast, fast, fast\n[02:12.86]Better hurry up and get in your bag, bag, bag, bag\n[02:15.82]I wear Dior, not a fad, fad, fad, fad\n[02:18.46]I know all these niggas gettin' mad, mad, mad, mad\n[02:21.36]My hand on my trigger, I'ma die for respect, yeah\n[02:24.08]Fucking with my money, you get dealt like that, yeah\n[Bridge]\n[02:26.92]Elevate, elevate, elevate myself\n[02:29.34]Now I'm on the ground, on the ground, haven't been myself\n[02:32.20]But it's okay, it's cool, won't push the issue\n[02:35.36]What happens next? A story to be continued, yeah\n[Chorus]\n[02:38.98]I been living fast, fast, fast, fast\n[02:41.66]Feeling really bad, bad, bad, bad\n[02:44.14]Time really moves fast, fast, fast, fast\n[02:46.78]Better hurry up and get in your bag, bag, bag, bag\n[02:49.70]I wear Dior, not a fad, fad, fad, fad\n[02:51.76]I know all these niggas gettin' mad, mad, mad, mad\n[02:54.72]My hand on my trigger, I'ma die for respect, yeah\n[02:57.98]Fucking with my money, you get dealt like that, yeah\n[Outro]\n[03:01.42]This is fire, hahaha, yeah\n[03:07.08]This is fire","words":[[9.88,10.04,"(Play"],[11.84,11.86,"it"],[11.9,11.96,"one"],[12.0,12.1,"more"],[12.14,12.28,"time)"],[12.34,12.34,"I"],[12.38,12.46,"been"],[12.5,12.66,"living"],[12.72,13.08,"fast,"],[13.14,13.4,"fast,"],[13.44,13.74,"fast,"],[13.78,14.08,"fast"],[14.84,15.14,"Feeling"],[15.18,15.44,"really"],[15.54,15.74,"bad,"],[15.9,16.06,"bad,"],[16.26,16.5,"bad,"],[16.6,16.82,"bad"],[17.32,17.58,"Time"],[17.72,17.92,"really"],[18.02,18.32,"moves"],[18.38,18.7,"fast,"],[18.74,19.04,"fast,"],[19.1,19.4,"fast,"],[19.44,19.82,"fast"],[19.94,20.14,"Better"]